timeline.body:
@mahendranv Is it within the scope of this PR to introduce `Simple` view mode? The same card view will be applied. The difference is that long press menus and video function buttons will be hidden. Image for what I mean by video function buttons:

![IMG_20221115_224318](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/79245641/201977544-ea8c7a35-27d7-44ef-b564-7e82c8928401.jpg)


Related issues: #7606, https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/issues/8492

@mahendranv One more modification is required. https://github.com/TeamNewPipe/NewPipe/pull/9555 is expected to add support for big thumbnails for channels in `Grid` view. IMO, subscriptions for `Card` view should be shown exactly as it's in that PR.

But channels in search results should be shown this way. Thumbnail should be in the middle of left side and description should auto-fit as required.
![IMG_20230114_185857](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/79245641/212472956-ade63116-c785-4f0d-b695-475612af25e9.png)

